question:
设$\alpha ,\beta ,\gamma $是三个不重合的平面,$l$是直线,给出下列命题
$\fbox{1} $若$\alpha \perp \beta ,\beta \perp \gamma ,$则$\alpha \perp \gamma $;
$\fbox{2} $若$l$上两点到$\alpha $的距离相等,则$l\parallel \alpha $;
$\fbox{3} $若$l\perp \alpha ,l\parallel \beta ,$则$\alpha \perp \beta $;
$\fbox{4} $若\alpha \parallel \beta ,l⊄β,且l∥α,则l∥β.
其中正确的命题是Options:
$A$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{2} $
$B$: $\\fbox{2} \\fbox{3} $
$C$: $\\fbox{2} \\fbox{4} $
$D$: $\\fbox{3} \\fbox{4} $

answer:
若$\alpha \perp \beta ,\beta \perp \gamma ,$则$\alpha $与$\gamma $可能相交,也可能平行,故$\fbox{1} $错误;
若$l$上两点到$\alpha $的距离相等,则$l$与$\alpha $可能相交,也可能平行,故$\fbox{2} $错误;
若$l\parallel \beta ,$则存在直线$a\subset \beta ,$使$l\parallel a,$又$l\perp \alpha ,\therefore a\perp \alpha ,$则$\alpha \perp \beta ,$故$\fbox{3} $正确;
若$\alpha \parallel \beta ,$且$l\parallel \alpha ,$则$l\subset \beta $或$l\parallel \beta ,$又由l⊄β,∴l∥β,故④正确;
故选D

