$\fbox{3} $存在两条平行直线$a,b,a\subset \alpha ,b\subset \beta ,a\parallel \beta ,b\parallel \alpha $;
$\fbox{4} $存在两条异面直线$a,b,a\subset \alpha ,b\subset \beta ,a\parallel \beta ,b\parallel \alpha .$
