question:
已知直线$m$、$n,$平面$\alpha $、$\beta ,$给出下列命题:
$\fbox{1} $若$m\perp \alpha ,n\perp \beta ,$且$m\perp n,$则$\alpha \perp \beta $;     
$\fbox{2} $若$m\parallel \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,$且$m\parallel n,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{3} $若$m\perp \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,$且$m\perp n,$则$\alpha \perp \beta $;     
$\fbox{4} $若$m\perp \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,$且$m\parallel n,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta .$
其中正确的命题是Options:
$A$: .$\\fbox{1} \\fbox{3} $
