$C$: $\\fbox{3} \\fbox{4} $
$D$: $\\fbox{1} $

answer:
$\fbox{1} $若$m\perp \alpha ,n\perp \beta ,$且$m\perp n,$则$\alpha \perp \beta ,$正确,因为;$n\perp \beta ,$且$m\perp n,$可得出 $m\parallel \beta $或 $m\subset \beta ,$又$m\perp \alpha $故可得$\alpha \perp \beta $
$\fbox{2} $若$m\parallel \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,$且$m\parallel n,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta ,$不正确,两个面中的一条线平行,两可能相交;
$\fbox{3} $若$m\perp \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,$且$m\perp n,$则$\alpha \perp \beta ,$不正确,$m\perp \alpha $且$m\perp n,$可得出$n\parallel \alpha ,$又$n\parallel \beta $故不能得出$\alpha \perp \beta $;     
$\fbox{4} $若$m\perp \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,$且$m\parallel n,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta ,$不正确,$m\perp \alpha $且$m\perp n,$可得出$n\parallel \alpha ,$又$n\parallel \beta ,$此平行关系不具有传递性故不能得出$\alpha \parallel \beta $
故选$D$

