对于$\fbox{2} ,$由$m\perp \alpha ,l\parallel m,$得$l\perp \alpha ,$再结合$l\subset \beta ,$可得$\alpha \perp \beta ,$故$\fbox{2} $正确;
对于$\fbox{3} ,$由$\alpha \parallel \beta ,l\perp \alpha ,$得$l\perp \beta ,$结合$m\parallel \beta ,$可得$l\perp m,$故$\fbox{3} $正确;
对于$\fbox{4} ,$由$\alpha \parallel \beta ,l\parallel \alpha ,$得$l\parallel \beta $或$l\subset \beta ,$结合$m\subset \beta ,$得$l$与$m$平行、相交或异面都有可能,故$\fbox{4} $不正确;
对于$\fbox{5} ,$若$\alpha \perp \beta ,\alpha \cap \beta =l,m\perp l,$当$m$是$\alpha $内的直线时有$m\perp \beta ,$但条件中没有“$m\subset \alpha $”这一条,
不一定有$m\perp \beta ,$故$\fbox{5} $不正确.
因此正确命题为$\fbox{2} \fbox{3} ,$共$2$个
故选$B$

