$\fbox{3} $是假命题,因为当$\alpha \parallel \beta $时,由$l\perp \alpha ,$得$l\perp \beta ,$且$m\subset \beta ,\therefore l\perp m,$故$l\parallel m$错误;
$\fbox{4} $是真命题,因为当$l\parallel m$时,由$l\perp \alpha ,$得$m\perp \alpha ,$又$m\subset \beta ,\therefore \alpha \perp \beta .$
所以,正确的命题有$\fbox{1} \fbox{4} $;
故选$C.$

