$\fbox{3} ,\alpha \parallel \gamma ,m\parallel \gamma $;
$\fbox{4} n\perp \alpha ,n\perp \beta ,m\perp \alpha .$是$m\perp \beta $的充分条件的有:Options:
$A$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{2} $
