$\fbox{2} $若$\alpha \perp \gamma ,\beta \perp \alpha ,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{3} $若$m\parallel \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,m\parallel n,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{4} $若$m$、$n$是异面直线,$m\perp \alpha ,m\parallel \beta ,n\perp \beta ,n\parallel \alpha ,$则$\alpha \perp \beta $
