故选$D.$

question:
给出下列四个命题:
$\fbox{1} $垂直于同一直线的两不同平面平行;
$\fbox{2} $若平面$\alpha \parallel $平面$\beta ,$直线$m\subset $平面$\alpha ,$则$m\parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{3} $直线$m$与平面$\alpha ,\beta $所成的线面角相等,则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{4} $若直线$m\perp $直线$n,$平面$\alpha \parallel $平面$\beta ,$直线$m\perp $平面$\alpha ,$则直线$n\parallel $平面$\beta $;
其中真命题的个数是Options:$A$: $1$
$B$: $2$
$C$: $3$
$D$: $4$

answer:
解:$A$不对,由面面平行的判定定理知,$m$与$n$可能相交;$B$不对,由面面平行的判定定理知少相交条件;
$C$不对,由面面垂直的性质定理知,$m$必须垂直交线;
故选$D.$

question:
已知$m$、$n$是两条不重合的直线,$\alpha $、$\beta $、$\gamma $是三个两两不重合的平面,给出下列四个命题:
$\fbox{1} $若$m\perp \alpha ,m\perp \beta ,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{2} $若$\alpha \perp \gamma ,\beta \perp \alpha ,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{3} $若$m\parallel \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,m\parallel n,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{4} $若$m$、$n$是异面直线,$m\perp \alpha ,m\parallel \beta ,n\perp \beta ,n\parallel \alpha ,$则$\alpha \perp \beta $
其中真命题是Options:$A$: $\\fbox{1} $和$\\fbox{2} $
$B$: $\\fbox{1} $和$\\fbox{3} $
$C$: $\\fbox{3} $和$\\fbox{4} $
$D$: $\\fbox{1} $和$\\fbox{4} $

answer:
解:$\fbox{1} $因为$\alpha $、$\beta $是不重合的平面,$m\perp \alpha ,m\perp \beta ,$所以$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{2} $若$\alpha \perp \gamma ,\beta \perp \alpha ,\alpha $、$\beta $、$\gamma $是三个两两不重合的平面,可知$\alpha $不一定平行$\beta $;
$\fbox{3} m\parallel \alpha ,n\parallel \beta ,m\parallel n,\alpha \beta $可能相交,不一定平行;
$\fbox{4} $因为$mn$两直线是异面直线,可知不平行,又因为$m\perp \alpha ,m\parallel \beta ,n\perp \beta ,n\parallel \alpha ,$可知$\alpha $、$\beta $只能满足垂直关系.
故选$D.$

