$\fbox{1} $若$m\perp \alpha ,n\parallel \alpha ,$则$m\perp n$;
$\fbox{2} $若$\alpha \perp \gamma ,\beta \perp \gamma ,$则$\alpha \parallel \beta $;
$\fbox{3} $若$m\parallel \alpha ,n\parallel \alpha ,$则$m\parallel n$;
$\fbox{4} $若$\alpha \parallel \beta ,\beta \parallel \gamma ,m\perp \alpha ,$则$m\perp \gamma .$
则正确的命题是 Options:  
$A$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{3} $
$B$: $\\fbox{2} \\fbox{3} $
$C$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{4} $
$D$: $\\fbox{2} \\fbox{4} $

($2014\cdot $孝感模拟)已知下列结论:
$\fbox{1} $若$a=b,b=c,$则$a=c$;
$\fbox{2} $若$a\parallel b,b\parallel c,$则$a\parallel c$;
$\fbox{3} |a\cdot b|=|a|\cdot |b|$;
$\fbox{4} $若$a\cdot b=a\cdot c,$则$b=c$的逆命题.
其中正确的是Options:$A$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{2} $
$B$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{4} $
$C$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{2} \\fbox{3} $
$D$: $\\fbox{1} \\fbox{2} \\fbox{4} $

answer:
由向量相等的概念知$\fbox{1} $正确;
因为零向量和任何向量共线,
所以当$b=0$时,结论$\fbox{2} $不成立,故$\fbox{2} $不正确;
因为$|a\cdot b|=|a||b||cos\theta |(\theta $是$a$与$b$的夹角),
所以当$|cos\theta |\neq 1$时,$\fbox{3} $不正确;$\fbox{4} $的逆命题是“若$b=c,$则$a\cdot b=a\cdot c$”,显然该结论是正确的.故选$B.$

